\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The game is a competitive multiplayer 2D typing game inspired by the classic Pong and air-hockey gameplay style. It combines fast-paced arcade mechanics with typing practice, making typing speed and accuracy an essential part of the gameplay rather than a separate activity.\
Two players compete against each other in an arena where a ball moves between their sides. Words or phrases appear directly on the ball, and players must type the displayed text correctly to hit or return the ball. The speed and accuracy of the player\'92s typing influence the power and velocity of the ball. Faster and more accurate typing results in stronger and faster attacks, creating an exciting balance between speed, precision, and strategy.\
The game also features a combo and reward system to encourage consistent accurate typing. Successfully typing five consecutive words perfectly activates a 2\'d7 score multiplier and puts the player into a special \'93Fire\'94 state. Continued successful typing can build higher combos and unlock additional visual effects and rewards.\
Beyond individual matches, the game includes a progression system where players can create and manage their own profiles, develop customizable characters, and unlock different outfits, boards, arenas, ball designs, effects, and animations. Power-ups can also appear during matches, providing temporary advantages and adding another strategic element to the gameplay.\
The main learning objective is to improve typing speed, accuracy, consistency, and reaction time through repeated gameplay. By combining competitive multiplayer mechanics, progression, customization, and measurable typing performance, the game aims to make typing practice engaging, challenging, and enjoyable.\
